This repository is source-available for private research and collaboration.
It is not released under the Apache License 2.0 (or any other OSI license).

Konigsberg is intended to be Apache 2.0 — the same license as mathlib, chosen
for frictionless interop — after reuse terms for algorithms ported from
Landon Rabern's choosability engine (see vendor/ and
empirical/konigsberg_empirical/coloring/) are resolved in writing with the
author. Until that resolution, do not treat this tree as Apache-licensed and
do not redistribute it as such.

You may clone and run this tree locally for research. A public GitHub
release as Apache is blocked on those port terms.

Full Apache 2.0 text (for the intended future license, not this snapshot):
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt
